      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, i think you might have the APA part wrong? i thought for 3 or more authors in APA 7th you just use \"et al.\" right from the first time you cite it. could you double check that for me? also what about chicago? i'm mostly using author-date for chicago but i'm confused about the 5 author thing specifically.",
